[h1]🇺🇦 Barony Ukrainian Localization[/h1]
[i]Game version: v5.0.2 · localization release: 5.0.2-2[/i]

Ukrainian localization of Barony: the interface, items, monsters, spells, compendium, achievements, story texts and seasonal themes. The original game files are not modified — the mod can be turned off at any time.

[b]Status:[/b] this is the first, [b]unproofread[/b] version. The texts are in Ukrainian but have not been reviewed by an editor yet — expect occasional inaccuracies, awkward wording or lines that run long. Proofreading is in progress; updates will follow as they are ready.

[h2]How to enable[/h2]
[olist]
[*]Subscribe to the mod.
[*]Launch Barony: main menu → [b]Custom Content[/b] → [b]Workshop Mods[/b] → «Українська локалізація Barony» → [b]Load Mod[/b].
[*]Restart the game if asked.
[/olist]

[h2]Alternative installation[/h2]
The mod files can be copied straight into the game folder — Ukrainian is then on from the start, without picking the mod in the menu:

[code]Steam\steamapps\workshop\content\371970\3711160804[/code]

Copy the contents of this folder into the folder where Barony is installed, replacing the existing files.

[i]Back up first: verifying the game files in Steam restores the originals and undoes the changes.[/i]

The same files are available as an archive on GitHub (Releases) for installing without the Workshop: unpack into [code]<game folder>\mods\Barony Ukrainian Localization\[/code] and enable it via [b]Custom Content → Local Mods[/b].

[h2]What is translated[/h2]
[list]
[*]Interface: menus, settings, tooltips, in-game messages
[*]Items, spells, monsters, classes and races, achievements
[*]Compendium (all entries)
[*]Story texts, the tutorial and all 34 books
[*]Seasonal themes
[*]Not translated: text baked into maps or the game code
[/list]

[h2]Known issues[/h2]
[list]
[*]The translation is not proofread — see "Status" above
[*]Some lines may not fit narrow interface elements
[*]Garbled characters (mojibake) appear in some places — being worked on, will be fixed in upcoming releases
[*]Some letters in the fonts are drawn incorrectly and are hard to recognize — will also be fixed in upcoming releases
[*]A few abbreviations are hard-coded in the game and stay in Latin (e.g. «LVL» above the XP bar) — may be resolved with a new version of the game
[*][code]books/compiled_books.json[/code]: the game compiles the mod's books into this file and does not always restore the original after the mod is disabled — the books then stay in Ukrainian or the game complains on start. If that happens, delete the file or verify the game files in Steam. Likely to be resolved with a new version of the game
[/list]

[h2]Bugs and suggestions[/h2]
Found a mistake, an untranslated line or text overflowing its frame — leave a comment or open an issue on GitHub:

[url=https://github.com/UKA-Localization/Barony-localization-uk-UA]Barony-localization-uk-UA — GitHub[/url]

No technical skills are needed to help with proofreading: just read the texts and flag what sounds unnatural in Ukrainian.

